OL,3,GNEWSATower block arsonist jailed for
OL,4,Asetting woman alight
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrivitt admitted charges of arson with
OL,7,Fintent to endanger life as well as
OL,8,Fwounding with intent and was sentenced
OL,9,Fat Stafford Crown Court on Wednesday.
